questions.checklist_observation:
Does the MOC procedure that has been defined, effectively address the following (Elaborate with suitable examples) :-
   •  Changes in Government Regulation or International Standards; 
   •  Make safe a currently unsafe situation or design; 
   •  Addressing changes in operating conditions; 
   •  Improving operability, maintainability or constructability;  
   •  Reducing or maintaining cost or schedule; 
   •  Improving organizational effectiveness; 
   •  Simplification or optimization of business processes; 
   •  Improving Environmental performance;
   •  Modification of programmable electronic systems software.

Resources:
 1) Adequacy of protective clothing (coat, trouser, gloves, boots and helmets);
 2) Availability of SCBA for firefighting operations and spare cylinders (at least 2 for each SCBA);
3) Adequacy of hose, nozzles, ladders, lighting equipment and pumps; and
4)Communication facility at ECC, walkie talkie sets during firefighting

